    "Reject5/cancel1/done_kind2 are actual added holding/terminal state; no new128bit operation identity copy.",
    "No actual-fit or full-error-order PASS before implementation and tests.",
    "Unused high172 bits are reserved; external next preserves them except legal retired clear zeros full view.",
